<description>&lt;p&gt;The junta launched a drone strike that damaged a Chinese gas pipeline facility and intensified air attacks on a historic Buddhist meditation centre, a monastery, villages in Sagaing and displacement camps in Rakhine, killing civilians. The United States held secret talks with Myanmar's military-backed rulers in Tokyo focusing on rare earth minerals. Iran shipped some LPG and jet fuel despite a US blockade. The Arakan Army seized over 20 soldiers' bodies and weapons in clashes near the Rakhine Ayeyarwady border. The conflict caused 2,332 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxOSURmbUNIZWk0Q3h5VDQtMzR4QU1mWENiWEJqZFdDeXNmdGdHVVBQXzV2elhPOFhOZ1FrV21YMWJZWS16R0E2eWV6VEZfc0ZMcjRNVVFJMVo2NWVOXzVtVHAweTZXR24tLUpHcUpwTGZxRGdJNkZHVHJlTEdhWHZ2Ylo4WG56eS0wanQyRXl2SVY2a091VlhwazhuUy1DbDlkb0ZF?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizAFBVV95cUxPUWpMVGJHdmxrQnR6QTZzWnBsTEk1VldyRmdLdmloMFBfYnNNZTg2YmxIMm02OXlTWTRsNkkxUDRONmJoLXc1bHMxcnloRS10dDJwdDg2SmMyN04xRTdmU1JUYzRBa2ZTNmI3aDlWc08zMTRGbnh0NWMwbmdYeElFNEtFdUxuUmxGMGNORVFfZmNGazNlaTFMa0FzcHJ4S01WMWZEQ3F6Rk1GeUJLVFBFNjdHSXJOdmprZURzYzQxTG11NTIzdFFXN1h0cEM?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisAFBVV95cUxNUW43alBLT1ZtZE5UZF9VNEY2ZDhBNjNOdk93dG1BZTNBZWZkQ050OVZGQmxUWURPdG16Q1pwTmRtNkFfQTNNWDJEazN2aHBRY1UwLW1MbGRSWXpLdVZRenB6SGY2cFhVcmFlRzRQZkhzV24xeTVtWnJfRTdfUHlIbktueERWSGNCLUw2bzIwdUw1a3FpQ3pMdEk4NE9HaVppTnlvaWNLV19xMy1pOEc0bw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMib0FVX3lxTE1rNGR1MUl2WERCS1lhTFNTT2paekRQbUpPTlEwT3QxYzJzS2ZrOGxTM3c1em5VcmRub2hyRHF0SWY0SWNpUDd5SF